# Smoke 9, phone and the narrow layout: Log out from the header's account menu; the lock screen comes up. Log out is
# nb-menu-logout in that menu (nsh/shell/Narrow.tsx; the iOS failure tree lists it, and no nb-menu-profile): the old
# path through the tax profile sheet's sheet-logout is gone.
click nb-avatar
wait_until nb-menu-logout --timeout-ms 5000
click nb-menu-logout
wait_until locked-screen --timeout-ms 10000 --screenshot
